§§ `Date helpers`

GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the later of` a `and` b MEANS
    IF a AT LEAST b THEN a ELSE b

GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the earlier of` a `and` b MEANS
    IF a AT MOST b THEN a ELSE b

GIVEN x IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount, if any, of` x MEANS
    CONSIDER x
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
    WHEN JUST v  THEN v

