@ref from the Rules and Terms, Article 1.2 (src 117-124), the four bullets of insurable interest
GIVEN r IS A `The insured's relationship to the policyholder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1.2 — an insurable interest` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `none of these` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

