@ref from the Rules and Terms, Article 1.3 (src 128-131), with Article 2.2 for the term
GIVEN a IS A `The application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1.3 — the insured is eligible` a MEANS
        a's `the insured residing in Vietnam`
    AND `add months` (a's `the insured's date of birth`) 6 AT MOST a's `date of entry into the contract`
    AND `age last birthday of someone born` (a's `the insured's date of birth`) `on the date` (a's `date of entry into the contract`) AT MOST 65
    AND `age last birthday of someone born` (a's `the insured's date of birth`) `on the date` (`add years` (a's `date of entry into the contract`) (a's `chosen contract term in years`)) AT MOST 70

@ref from the Rules and Terms, Articles 1.2, 1.3 and 2.2
GIVEN a IS A `The application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Part I — the application meets the eligibility terms` a MEANS
        `Article 1.2 — may be the policyholder` (a's `the policyholder`) (a's `date of entry into the contract`)
    AND `Article 1.2 — an insurable interest` (a's `the insured's relationship to the policyholder`)
    AND `Article 1.2 — the insured's written consent is in place` a
    AND `Article 1.3 — the insured is eligible` a
    AND `Article 2.2 — a term the policyholder may choose` (a's `chosen contract term in years`)

