    AND `the insured alive when the application was accepted`

§§§ `1.8 The contract year, and 1.9 the anniversary`
-- src:151 | 1.8 Năm hợp đồng: khoảng thời gian 1 năm tính từ Ngày hiệu lực hợp đồng hoặc từ
-- src:153 | 1.9 Ngày kỷ niệm năm hợp đồng: ngày kỷ niệm hàng năm của Ngày hiệu lực hợp

@ref from the Rules and Terms, Article 1.9 (src 153)
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A DATE
`contract anniversary number` n `of` p MEANS
    `add years` (p's `effective date`) n

-- Contract year 1 runs from the effective date; year n from the (n-1)th anniversary.
@ref from the Rules and Terms, Article 1.8 (src 151)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the contract year of` p `in which falls` d MEANS
    IF   `contract anniversary number` k `of` p AT MOST d
    THEN k PLUS 1
    ELSE k
    WHERE
        k MEANS DATE_YEAR d MINUS DATE_YEAR (p's `effective date`)

§§§ `1.10 The end of the contract term (with Article 2.2)`
-- src:155 | 1.10 Ngày kết thúc thời hạn hợp đồng: ngày cuối cùng của Thời hạn hợp đồng và

-- Article 2.2 caps the term at the anniversary immediately after the insured reaches 70. The
-- term ends on that anniversary or on the chosen anniversary, whichever is earlier (fork F-02).
@ref from the Rules and Terms, Articles 1.10 and 2.2 (src 155-156, 307-311)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A DATE
`the anniversary immediately after the insured reaches 70, of` p MEANS
    IF   `contract anniversary number` k `of` p AT LEAST seventieth
    THEN `contract anniversary number` k `of` p
    ELSE `contract anniversary number` (k PLUS 1) `of` p
    WHERE
        seventieth MEANS `add years` (p's `the insured's date of birth`) 70
        k MEANS DATE_YEAR seventieth MINUS DATE_YEAR (p's `effective date`)

@ref from the Rules and Terms, Articles 1.10 and 2.2
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A DATE
`the end of the contract term of` p MEANS
    `the earlier of` (`contract anniversary number` (p's `chosen contract term in years`) `of` p)
        `and` (`the anniversary immediately after the insured reaches 70, of` p)

@ref from the Rules and Terms, Article 2.2: the term is the chosen one only if the 70 cap does not cut it short
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the term runs its chosen length` p MEANS
    `the end of the contract term of` p EQUALS `contract anniversary number` (p's `chosen contract term in years`) `of` p

§§§ `In force`

-- The contract is in force from the effective date to the end of the term, except from the
-- date it last ceased to be in force (a lapse under 15.1, or a termination under 16) until
-- a later reinstatement (12.1(h)). The grace period of 15.1 is inside "in force".
@ref from the Rules and Terms, Articles 1.7, 1.10, 12.1(h), 15.1 and 16
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
p `in force on` d MEANS
        d AT LEAST p's `effective date`
    AND d AT MOST `the end of the contract term of` p
    AND `not ceased on that date`
    WHERE
        `not ceased on that date` MEANS
            CONSIDER p's `date the contract last ceased to be in force`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
            WHEN JUST c  THEN d LESS THAN c OR `reinstated after` c
        `reinstated after` c MEANS
            CONSIDER p's `date of the latest reinstatement`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST r  THEN r GREATER THAN c AND d AT LEAST r

